        "status": "success",
        "value": {
          "stderr_lines": [],
          "stdout_lines": [
            "cli.py — Quick Reference",
            "",
            "What pipx installs:",
            "- A global CLI (per-user). It does NOT auto-modify your projects.",
            "- CLI aliases: `qiongli`, `ql`, `research-skills`, `rsk`, `rsw` (same behavior).",
            "",
            "What `cli.py upgrade` modifies by default:",
            "- Full local plugin surface: Codex/Claude Code get CLI-managed local plugins.",
            "- Full MCP surface: Antigravity/Hermes get managed `qiongli mcp serve` client configs.",
            "- Legacy global skills and Codex/Claude standalone MCP configs are cleaned after plugin install succeeds.",
            "- Use `--surface skills --profile partial` to keep the old skills-only upgrade behavior.",
            "",
            "Project-facing assets are opt-in:",
            "- Use `qiongli init --project-dir .` to create project config + .env",
            "- Use `qiongli clean --project-dir .` to remove stale project-local assets",
            "",
            "Typical usage:",
            "1) Check:   cli.py check --repo <owner>/<repo>",
            "2) Upgrade: cli.py upgrade --repo <owner>/<repo> --target all",
            "3) Init:    cli.py init --project-dir .",
            "4) Clean:   cli.py clean --project-dir .",
            "5) Doctor:  cli.py doctor --cwd .",
            "",
            "Tip:",
            "- `cli.py install` and `cli.py upgrade` default to `--profile full --surface plugin`.",
            "- `cli.py upgrade` migrates old skills/MCP surfaces only after the new plugin install succeeds.",
            "- `cli.py clean` removes stale workflow copies / CLAUDE.md / .gemini quickstart.",
            "- Set `QIONGLI_REPO=owner/repo` to avoid passing `--repo` every time."
          ]
        }
      },
